    '|b||Asked for one idea in social science that is both true and not obvious, Paul Samuelson named this one.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6960
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:c2ub15'
    '|a||But those four loaves only exist if they swap. Who gets them?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5080
      voice: gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy
    '|b||That depends on the price. Say Jon trades eight fish for six loaves: three quarters of a loaf a fish.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6760
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:1uej4bn'
    '|a||Then Jon ends with six loaves and eight fish: two loaves better than alone.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5680
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1rkwzu8'
    '|b||And Mia ends with eighteen loaves and sixteen fish. Two better, too.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5800
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:1oso64k'
    '|a||Both points sit outside their own lines. Each has more than they could ever make alone.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5400
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1tkja3w'
    '|b||What if Jon drives a harder bargain: a whole loaf per fish?':
      mp3: 
