      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:1vsmmsf'
    '|a||Then Jon takes all four extra loaves, and Mia gains nothing.':
      mp3: 
