      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:hdnm6c'
    '|a||Past one loaf, Mia would rather catch her own fish; below a half, Jon would rather bake. So the price lands between their two costs.':
